## 📊 n8n Workflow Example

### Basic Flow:
```
┌─────────────┐
│ Chat Trigger │ (Webhook)
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│  AI Agent   │ (GPT-4o)
│  (Medical)  │
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
   Response to User
```

### Advanced Flow (with Translation):
```
┌─────────────┐
│ Chat Trigger │
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│   Detect    │ (Language Detection)
│   Language  │
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│  Translate  │ (if needed)
│   to English │
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│  AI Agent   │ (Process in English)
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
┌─────────────┐
│  Translate  │ (back to user language)
│   Response  │
└──────┬──────┘
       │
       ▼
   Response to User
```

